    "result": "I implemented `invoice_totals` in `solution.py` following `spec.md`, keeping the signature unchanged. Each line's net is computed as unit price × qty less its own discount, with the 5% bulk discount applied on top for standard lines of 10 or more, then rounded to cents with half-up rounding. Tax is computed per line on that rounded net. Totals are sums of the per-line values, and credit is applied as `min(credit, gross)`. Input validation raises `ValueError` for every case in the spec, including rejecting `bool` for `qty`. I wrote `tests/test_solution.py` with 24 tests covering the worked examples, per-line rounding, bulk-discount edge cases, `tax_by_rate`, credit handling, empty input, discount boundaries and each validation error. Running `python -m pytest -q tests` gives 24 passed. I did not create any other files or install packages.",
